---
source: crates/biome_css_parser/tests/spec_test.rs
expression: snapshot
---

## Input

```css
.variable-unit{width:attr(data-width $unit,10px);color:red;}
.interpolated-unit{width:attr(data-width #{$unit},10px);color:green;}
.prefixed-unit{width:attr(data-width r#{$suffix},1rem);color:blue;}
.variable-name-and-unit{width:attr($name$unit,10px);color:purple;}
.hyphen-unit{width:attr(data-width -#{$unit},10px);color:teal;}
.literal-controls{width:attr(data-width px,10px);opacity:attr(data-progress %,0%);}
.type-outside-attr{width:type(<length>);color:orange;}
.after{display:block}
.namespaced-unit{width:attr(data-width units.$unit,10px);color:black;}

```


